{"id":"6b66927fed54f174","group":"90","path":"90/90-cor-creative-not-recursive.md","title":"Creative Sets Not Recursive","display":"cor-creative-not-recursive — Creative Sets Not Recursive","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-cor-creative-not-recursive","aliases":["90-cor-creative-not-recursive"],"display":"cor-creative-not-recursive — Creative Sets Not Recursive","depends_on":["[[90-df-creative-set]]","[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]","[[90-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate]]","[[90-df-program-numbering]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-cor-creative-not-recursive"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-cor-creative-not-recursive</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-creative-not-recursive — Creative Sets Not Recursive"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"40041a5a5d6a4573\" href=\"?note=40041a5a5d6a4573\" title=\"90-df-creative-set\">90-df-creative-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1316be710802d6a1\" href=\"?note=1316be710802d6a1\" title=\"90-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate\">90-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" href=\"?note=5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" title=\"90-df-program-numbering\">90-df-program-numbering</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" href=\"?note=5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" title=\"90-df-program-numbering\">90-df-program-numbering</a>；递归集及其补集为 c.e.，并由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1316be710802d6a1\" href=\"?note=1316be710802d6a1\" title=\"90-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate\">90-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate</a> 的等价式取得对应索引。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(K\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Creative}\">\\(\\mathrm{Creative}\\)</span> (creative-set predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RecPred}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{RecPred}_1\\)</span> (recursive-set class)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}creative\\text{-}not\\text{-}recursive}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{Creative}(K)\n\\Longrightarrow\nK\\notin\\mathrm{RecPred}_1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}creative\\text{-}not\\text{-}recursive}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{Creative}(K)\n\\Longrightarrow\nK\\notin\\mathrm{RecPred}_1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Proof\">[Proof]</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\in\\mathrm{RecPred}_1\">\\(K\\in\\mathrm{RecPred}_1\\)</span>，则存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e=\\mathbb N\\setminus K\">\\(W_e=\\mathbb N\\setminus K\\)</span>。取创造性见证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>，其条件在该 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 上给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(e)\\in(\\mathbb N\\setminus K)\\setminus W_e=\\varnothing\">\\(p(e)\\in(\\mathbb N\\setminus K)\\setminus W_e=\\varnothing\\)</span>，矛盾。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 可判定，则其补集是 c.e.；把整个补集代入生产性条件会要求产生一个同时属于且不属于该补集的新元素，矛盾。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Proof","text":"[Proof]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-creative-set","status":"resolved","id":"40041a5a5d6a4573","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-creative-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"137d75d038de4a47","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"1316be710802d6a1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-program-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$W_e$ 使用 [[90-df-program-numbering]]；递归集及其补集为 c.e.，并由 [[90-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate]] 的等价式取得对应索引。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"1316be710802d6a1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$W_e$ 使用 [[90-df-program-numbering]]；递归集及其补集为 c.e.，并由 [[90-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate]] 的等价式取得对应索引。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"W_e","display":false},{"tex":"K\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Creative}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RecPred}_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}creative\\text{-}not\\text{-}recursive}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{Creative}(K)\n\\Longrightarrow\nK\\notin\\mathrm{RecPred}_1.","display":true},{"tex":"K\\in\\mathrm{RecPred}_1","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"W_e=\\mathbb N\\setminus K","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"p(e)\\in(\\mathbb N\\setminus K)\\setminus W_e=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false}],"bytes":1304,"backlinks":[{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-142","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-cor-creative-not-recursive.md]]\n[[90-cor-godel-sound.md]]\n[[90-cor-henkin-provable.md]]\n[[90-cor-henkin-sentence.md]]\n[[90-cor-hypersimple-not-creative.md]]\n[[90-cor-liar-independent.md]]"}],"outgoing":["40041a5a5d6a4573","137d75d038de4a47","1316be710802d6a1","5d66bf24ea0c6e5a"]}